<runspec version="MOVES5.0.1">
	<description><![CDATA[Rates-scale (MESOSCALE_LOOKUP) DEFAULT-domain run for Washtenaw, 2020, August weekday hour 7,
WITHOUT retrofit rows: the un-retrofitted twin of rates-retrofit, captured
to measure its factors.
Single-unit short-haul trucks (gasoline and diesel) and the diesel combination
long-haul truck; THC, CO, NMHC and the PM2.5 total with its four species at
running and start exhaust; road types 1 and 4. OnRoadRetrofitStrategy multiplies
BaseRateOutput (emissionRate, meanBaseRate) as well as MOVESWorkerOutput, and the
rate tables are written from BaseRateOutput. Captured for moves.esm PLAN.md
section 7.3.79 (On-Road Retrofit).]]></description>
